About us

Bitget is the world's largest Universal Exchange (UEX), serving over 125 million users and offering access to over 2M crypto tokens, 100+ tokenized stocks, ETFs, commodities, FX, and precious metals such as gold. The ecosystem is committed to helping users trade smarter with its AI agent, which co-pilots trade execution.

Bitget is driving crypto adoption through strategic partnerships with LALIGA and MotoGP™. Aligned with its global impact strategy, Bitget has joined hands with UNICEF to support blockchain education for 1.1 million people by 2027. Bitget currently leads in the tokenized TradFi market, providing the industry's lowest fees and highest liquidity across 150 regions worldwide.

What you'll do

• Responsible for integrating different blockchains and enhancing the wallet's support for the chains;
• Responsible for designing and developing the interface between the wallet and business systems;
• Responsible for the deployment and operation of the wallet services;
• Follow up on the latest developments in blockchain technology;
• Deeply understand the security issues in the blockchain field to ensure that user assets are not lost;

What you'll need

• Master common data structures and algorithms;
• Proficient in Java language, with experience in languages such as Go, Node.js, etc. will be an added advantage;
• Master unit testing and refactoring techniques, with high code readability;
• Familiar with common consensus algorithms, such as PoW, PBFT, PoS, DPos, Raft, etc.;
• Have a certain understanding of the underlying implementation of public blockchains, not limited to P2P networks, EVM, cross-chain technologies;
• Have experience related to POS, with practical experience in staking and restaking;
• Familiar with distributed application middleware, including but not limited to: MySQL, Redis, MQ, etc. The position requires real experience in connecting to public blockchains, at least having connected to BTC series and ETH series;
• Have relevant experience in blockchain security architecture and solutions as an added advantage;

岗位职责：
• 负责集成不同区块链，增加钱包对链上的支持；
• 负责钱包与业务系统接口设计与开发；
• 负责钱包服务的部署和运维；
• 跟进区块链技术的最新进展；
• 深入理解区块链领域的安全问题，确保用户资产不受到损失；

任职要求：
• 掌握常用数据结构和算法；
• 熟练掌握 Java 语言，有golang、nodejs 等语言经验的为加分项；
• 掌握单元测试、重构技术，代码可读性高；
• 熟悉常见共识算法，如PoW、PBFT、PoS、DPos、Raft等；
• 对Ethereum、Bitcoin、EOS、Polkadot、Cosmos、Solana、Ton等公链底层实现有一定了解，不限于P2P网络，EVM，跨链技术
• 有POS相关的经验，staking与restaking有实际经验；
• 熟悉分布式应用中间件，包括但不限于：MySQL、Redis、MQ等。岗位要求有真实对接公链的经验，至少对接过BTC系列、ETH系列；
• 有区块链安全架构与解决方案的相关经验为加分项；

Why Bitget?
• Bitget is the world's leading web 3 platform for copy trading and one of the world's largest and most respected exchanges
• We are a global company with staff members from over 50 different countries and regions
• We are growing and looking for world-class ambitious talents to help us continue this journey
• We have a streamlined structure that empowers employees to work efficiently, delivering the best results in a short timeframe
• We offer competitive salaries and benefits
• Blockchain technology and digital assets have the potential to change finance in a way no other technology can - be part of it!

If you are ambitious and believe that digital assets could be the next financial and technological revolution, please apply!

For more information regarding candidates' personal data processing, please refer to Bitget Candidate Privacy Notice.

